netherworldly wand blasphemy~
This wand looks incredibly strange, like nothing you've seen in this world.
It is jet black, and about the length and width of your leg; making it an
excellent, although strange, walking staff. There is a crystalline ball
hovering strangely at the tip of it and, looking within, you are able to see
several miniature soul-like figures swirling hideously inside. You wonder
where the Tong could've possibly gotten something so utterly alien to this
civilization. It was probably stolen from a travelling mage; forged from
pure magic and conjured reagents, its orgins baffle you completely.
~
