~
8 0 ao 0
0 0 0 0 0
3 3 2000 75 0 1
E
porcelin figurine~
This is a porcelain figurine of the Taoist Immortal Li Tieguai. He is
modeled with his right foot resting on a crutch and holds a yellow
double gourd flask in his right hand. He wears a long coat that is
painted with several multi-colored flowers on a black background. The
delicate silken cloth also has a border around the edges consisting of
more beautiful flowers on a yellow background. He wears aubergine-colored
pants with flowers painted on them and his hair is black. Li Tieguai is
standing on a square base that is open in the front and has a yellow
kerchief draped on it. The sides are solid and have flowers on a light
turquoise background painted with a "cracked ice" pattern.
~
