E
sacred amulet yhul'lha~
It is a rare, sacred amulet, probably used in religious rites. The top
half depicts six birds flanking a vase who are resting on energy spirals
on the outer ring. The amulet has its orgins in ancient long-life and
fortune-bestowing rituals. It is made of a meteoric metal which is
totally alien to you. The real significance of this talisman - art and
antique value aside - is the arcane and seemingly ancient words carved
into the back of the medallion. They look to be written in a language
you've never seen before: &WCthulhu&n fhtagan.
~
E
cthulhu~
You've heard blasphemous rumours of the immortal, and dream-invading
Cthulhu, but you've never actually believed them until there was hard
evidence to prove its existance...
~
