E
mold~
It is apparently the currency of Kir-Oshi. Aside from the eternal face of
Ts'ao Ts'ao, there are some words written on it which you do not understand.
It must have taken literally ages for the mold to be crafted; the detail of
it absolutely fascinates you.
~
E
strange metal apparatus~
It looks more like a torture device than a coin press. The coins are made
from the metal, apparently brass, which is heaped in a haphazard pile next
to the apparatus. The metal is then heated up to a liquid form, and poured
into a &Wmold&n. There is a screw handle on top of it, which turns a wheel
to tighten it. The Tong then strike it with a heavy sledge hammer, finalizing
the process. At the base of the press, there are some strange &Wcarvings&n
that catch your attention.
~
E
carvings~
They read:
   "Ts'ao Ts'ao chung pao" - The Heavy Currency of Ts'ao Ts'ao
~
